        "pdfPage": 1,
        "quote": "They use a trans-\nformer architecture and are trained via unsupervised learning, RLHF, and Constitutional AI"
      }
    },
    "trainingData": {
      "status": "stated",
      "value": "proprietary mix of public internet data, licensed datasets, and user/crowdworker data; cutoff early 2023; ~10% non-English",
