  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "Claude 2 is framed as a continuous evolution of prior Claude models, not a transformative change.", "tone": "neutral",
      "source": {
        "page": "1",
        "pdfPage": 1,
        "quote": "Claude 2 does not represent a transformative change from our prior models and research."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Of four automated harmfulness flags for Claude 2, manual review found only one clearly harmful jailbreak case.", "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
        "page": "6",
        "pdfPage": 6,
        "quote": "On manual inspection, in three of the cases its\nresponse did not seem harmful. However, in the other case, the model was disrupted by the jailbreak attempts\nin about half of its sampled responses."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At launch Anthropic planned to support 100K context rather than the full 200K trained capability.", "tone": "neutral",
      "source": {
        "page": "9",
        "pdfPage": 9,
        "quote": "As we note in our launch blog post, we will support 100K at launch rather than this full context window."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding new Claude 2 capabilities can trade off against existing ones and complicates personality balancing.", "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
        "page": "11",
        "pdfPage": 11,
        "quote": "Some of Claude 2’s new or improved capabilities have had some subtle costs in\nother areas."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Authors expect near-future misuse and misalignment dangers to be very significant.", "tone": "bad",
      "source": {
        "page": "11",
        "pdfPage": 11,
        "quote": "the dangers from misuse and misalignment from near-future AI systems\nwill be very significant, presenting an enormous challenge for AI developers."
      }
    }
  ],
